(2, 'Sit earum soluta cu', 'Rina Good', 'sit-earum-soluta-cu', '<h5><ol type=\"A\"></ol></h5>', 'Autumn Mckee', 'Dolor magnam sequi v', 'Iusto eum mollitia m', '<h4><ol type=\"A\"></ol></h4>', '', 'Perferendis magni cu', 'Dolor ut enim velit', '', 'Hic dignissimos dolo', '<h1><ol type=\"A\"></ol></h1>', 'Quidem provident ne', '<h2><ul style=\"list-style-type: \'â–¶\'\"></ul></h2>', '', '', 'Exercitation tempora', '<p></p><ol type=\"A\"></ol>', '', '', 'Ea nostrum cillum cu', '', 'Nihil dolores porro', 'Facilis minus dolore', 'Eum sit ut quasi sin', 'Nulla dicta atque li', 'Dolores earum est q', 'Do voluptas laboris', 'Cupidatat quidem in', 'Tempora voluptatem', 'Deserunt nihil illum', 'Autem reprehenderit', 'Molestiae eum et tem', 'Quas assumenda exped', '', 'Culpa culpa aut ex', '<p></p><ol type=\"A\"></ol>', 'Laboriosam proident', 'Sed id velit ut volu', '1', 'Published', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reprehenderit enim', 'Esse omnis totam quo', 'Est et aut sed perfe', 20, 20, 20, '2026-04-09 00:48:11', '2026-04-09 02:19:20', '2026-04-09 02:19:20'),
(3, 'Vendor Management Solution', 'Vendor Management Solution', 'vendor-management-solution', '', 'Vendor Management Solution Advisory', 'Vendor Management Solution Advisory', '', '<p>Independent guidance to help you build and manage the workforce programs,<br>\r\nprocesses, and technologies that support your vendor strategy and operational goals.</p>', '2933', 'Connect with Us', 'https://hamzahk15.sg-host.com/contact/', '', 'What Is Vendor Management?', '<p>Vendor management is the structured oversight of the staffing suppliers that support your contingent workforce. It includes setting program goals, defining performance expectations, ensuring compliance, and managing the processes and tools used to coordinate suppliers and contingent resources. Effective vendor management improves visibility, strengthens governance, and provides better control over supplier performance, cost, and delivery.</p>', 'What Is Vendor Management Solution Advisory?', '<p>Organizations often struggle with vendor programs that lack structure, visibility, and consistent supplier performance. Fragmented processes and unclear compliance expectations can create gaps that ultimately impact business outcomes. TimeMatters provides independent program-level advisory to help you build a cohesive vendor management framework—strengthening governance, supplier alignment, process efficiency, and supporting technology selection.</p>\r\n<p>TimeMatters provides independent advisory to help organizations design a cohesive vendor management framework—focusing on governance, supplier alignment, workflow optimization, and the technology required to support the program.</p>\r\n<p>As part of this service, we offer Vendor Management Software Advisory to ensure your platform selection and configuration match your operational requirements. We also support challenges with time-based Statement of Work (SOW) engagements, helping clarify scope, establish controls, and integrate SOW oversight into your broader vendor management strategy.</p>\r\n<p>Our advisory approach ensures your program is structured, scalable, and able to deliver measurable value.</p>', '', '', 'How Our Vendor Management Solution Advisory Works', '<p>TimeMatters begins by assessing your current vendor landscape, processes, and program structure. We identify gaps, define requirements, and establish governance standards across roles, workflows, compliance, and performance expectations.</p>\r\n<p>If a Vendor Management Software is required, we guide you through platform selection, configuration, integration, and supplier onboarding. For organizations using SOW arrangements, we evaluate existing practices and help implement milestone tracking, approval workflows, and deliverable validation.</p>\r\n<p>Following implementation, we provide ongoing performance monitoring and program refinement to keep your vendor ecosystem aligned and effective.</p>', '2937', '', 'Benefits of Vendor Management Solution Advisory', '', 'Independent Program Guidance', 'Technology Alignment', 'Clear Vendor Governance', 'SOW Program Control', 'Efficient Processes', 'Sustained Performance', 'Advisory driven solely by your needs.', 'Support with VMS evaluation and implementation.', 'Defined expectations and stronger accountability.', 'Improved oversight of time-based engagements.', 'Streamlined workflows across suppliers and teams.', 'Continuous review of program outcomes and spend.', '', 'Why Organizations Work With TimeMatters Inc.', '<p>TimeMatters provides fully independent vendor management expertise, combining governance, workforce operations, VMS capability, and SOW oversight. We help organizations build programs that are structured, compliant, and aligned with real operational needs—not just theoretical frameworks.</p>', 'Connect with Us', 'https://hamzahk15.sg-host.com/contact/', '1', 'Published', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 20, 20, NULL, '2026-04-09 00:53:31', '2026-04-11 13:48:44', NULL),
(4, 'The Right Resources, One Call Away', 'The Right Resources, One Call Away', 'the-right-resources-one-call-away', '', 'The Right Resources, One Call Away', 'The Right Resources, One Call Away', '', '<p>\r\nConnect with skilled contingent resources through TimeMatters’ trusted network of<br> engaged suppliers and verified contractor partnerships.\r\n</p>', '2942', 'Connect with Us', 'https://hamzahk15.sg-host.com/contact/', '', 'About Our On-Demand Resource Service', '<p>\r\nSourcing qualified contingent resources quickly—while maintaining compliance—can be challenging for any organization. TimeMatters makes this easier by providing access to a network of vetted staffing suppliers and independent contractors across Canada. Every resource is screened for skills, capability, and compliance, helping you build a reliable and agile workforce.</p>', 'How We Help You Access the Right Resources', '<p>\r\nTimeMatters begins by understanding your specific workforce needs, including the required skills, timelines, and role expectations. We then engage our supplier network to identify qualified resources that align with your objectives. Each candidate goes through a structured verification process to validate their credentials and ensure they meet your standards. After selection, we support onboarding with documentation and setup to ensure a smooth start. Throughout the engagement, we maintain communication with both your team and the resource to monitor performance, satisfaction, and ongoing compliance.</p>', '', '', 'Need Resources Beyond Canada?', '<p> For organizations with operations outside of Canada, TimeMatters can extend resource support through our broader global supplier network. This ensures you can source qualified contingent resources in additional regions when required—maintaining the same standards of quality, reliability, and compliance across all locations.</p>', '2941', '', 'The Advantages You’ll Experience', '', 'Faster Access to Qualified Resources', 'Consistent Quality', 'Flexible & Scalable Workforce Options', 'Vendor-Neutral Sourcing', '', '', 'Quickly source skilled professionals through our engaged supplier network.', 'All suppliers and contractors are vetted for capability, reliability, and service quality.', 'Easily ramp up or adjust resources based on operational needs.', 'Unbiased recommendations without staffing affiliations or preferential placements.', '', '', '', 'What Sets TimeMatters Apart', '<p> Organizations choose TimeMatters because we focus on quality, compliance, and timely delivery. Our vendor-neutral approach ensures fair sourcing decisions, while our strong supplier relationships help secure dependable resources across a wide range of skill sets. With structured processes and clear communication, we provide a straightforward, scalable way to access skilled contingent resources.</p>', 'Connect with Us', 'https://hamzahk15.sg-host.com/contact/', '1', 'Published', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Need skilled resources quickly?', '<p>Connect with TimeMatters Inc. to access qualified professionals with ease.</p>', 'Connect with a Resource Specialist', 'https://hamzahk15.sg-host.com/contact/', '', '', '', 20, 20, NULL, '2026-04-11 05:57:54', '2026-04-16 08:08:31', NULL),
(5, 'Payrolling & Independent Contractor Management', 'Payrolling & Independent Contractor Management', 'payrolling-independent-contractor-management', '', 'Payrolling & Independent Contractor Management', 'Payrolling & Independent Contractor Management', '', '<p>Simplify payrolling, protect compliance, and manage contingent workers confidently.</p>', '2943', 'Connect with Us', 'https://hamzahk15.sg-host.com/contact/', '', 'What Is Payrolling & Independent Contractor Management?', '<p> Managing payrolled workers and independent contractors can become complicated, especially when navigating different jurisdictions, payment rules, and documentation requirements. TimeMatters supports organizations by providing an impartial Employer-of-Record (EOR) and contractor management framework that ensures workers are paid correctly, remain compliant with legal obligations, and are onboarded smoothly. Whether you’re managing a local workforce or extending into new locations, we help reduce administrative burden and compliance risk.</p>', 'How Our Payrolling & Independent Contractor Management Model Works', '<p>\r\n TimeMatters begins by confirming the correct worker classification to help minimize misclassification or legal exposure. Once the engagement type is established, we manage all onboarding steps, ensuring documentation, eligibility, and compliance requirements are properly met. Payroll administration is handled end-to-end, including payments, remittances, and tracking across regions where needed. Our team also oversees tax and legal obligations to ensure alignment with local labor standards. Throughout the engagement, consolidated reporting provides a clear view of worker status, payments, and compliance across your program.</p>', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Why Organizations Work With TimeMatters Inc.', '<p>TimeMatters operates with complete vendor and technology neutrality, meaning our payrolling and contractor management guidance is based solely on what is right for your organization. Our experience supporting multi-location payrolls, combined with expertise in workforce governance, allows us to blend compliance protection with operational efficiency. Integrated within broader Vendor Management and MSP programs, our payrolling model helps organizations maintain a consistent, compliant contingent workforce.</p>', 'Connect with Us', 'https://hamzahk15.sg-host.com/contact/', '1', 'Published', 'Benefits of Payrolling & Independent Contractor Management', '', '2946', 'Reduced Misclassification Risk', 'Consistent review of worker type and documentation helps protect your organization.', 'Streamlined Payroll & Administration', 'A single, reliable process for managing payrolled workers and contractors.', 'Compliance Across Regions', 'Support for Canadian workforce requirements with the ability to extend internationally when needed.', 'Transparent Reporting', 'Clear visibility into payments, compliance checks, and worker status.', 'Vendor-Neutral Service Delivery', 'No staffing affiliations, ensuring impartial support.', 'Talk to an Expert', '<p> Need to simplify payrolling, reduce compliance risks, or better manage independent contractors? Connect with TimeMatters Inc. for payrolling and contractor management solutions that protect your organization and support your workforce.</p>', 'Speak with a Payrolling Advisor', 'https://hamzahk15.sg-host.com/contact/', '', '', '', 20, 20, NULL, '2026-04-11 06:11:04', '2026-04-16 08:09:12', NULL),
(6, 'Vendor Management Solutions', 'Vendor Management Solutions', 'vendor-management-solutions', '', 'Vendor Management Solutions', 'Vendor Management Solutions', '', '<p>Access higher-quality talent faster — supported by our global network of vetted staffing vendors and<br> our vendor-neutral &amp; technology -neutral management model designed for reliable workforce delivery.</p>', '2944', 'Connect with Us', 'https://hamzahk15.sg-host.com/contact/', '', 'What We Do', '<p>Organizations navigating multiple staffing suppliers often face communication issues, inconsistent talent quality, delayed payments, and compliance challenges. These issues disrupt workforce continuity and create unnecessary complexity.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The TimeMatters Vendor Management model streamlines the entire process of working with your staffing suppliers — from engaging new resources to ensuring they are paid accurately and on time. By simplifying every step in the contingent workforce supply chain, you gain a clear understanding of your contingent headcount, how much you’re spending, and where your resources are being used. This approach reduces overall costs, improves access to high-quality talent through our vetted vendor network, and strengthens compliance with all relevant regulations.</p>', 'Why Access to Quality Talent Comes First', '<p>Because TimeMatters partners with a global network of vetted staffing vendors, clients maintain quick access to the talent they need—often faster and with more consistency than traditional models. This ensures not only speed, but also dependable quality and reliability across the workforce.</p>', '', '', 'Need Resources Beyond Canada?', '<p> For organizations with operations outside of Canada, TimeMatters can extend resource support through our broader global supplier network. This ensures you can source qualified contingent resources in additional regions when required—maintaining the same standards of quality, reliability, and compliance across all locations.</p>', '2941', '', 'How TimeMatters Helps You', '', 'Visibility', 'Savings', 'Compliance', 'Control', '', '', 'TimeMatters streamlines fragmented processes into one clear view, giving you real-time insight into contingent headcount, spend, and vendor activity.', 'By standardizing workflows, reducing billing errors, and accelerating access to quality talent, TimeMatters helps eliminate inefficiencies and lower overall program costs.', 'With structured processes that enforce contracts, rate cards, and legal requirements, TimeMatters reduces risk and keeps your entire contingent workforce aligned and compliant.', 'Centralized, simplified processes give you consistent control over vendor performance, payment accuracy, and talent delivery—without the complexity of managing it all yourself.', '', '', '', 'Why Organizations Work with Us', '<p>\r\nTimeMatters offers an impartial, vendor-neutral and technology-neutral model that exists solely to support your organization—not any staffing supplier. Our experience in vendor governance, workforce quality management, and payment oversight makes us the ideal partner for organizations managing multiple suppliers or large-scale contingent programs.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWe help improve workforce delivery timelines, strengthen vendor accountability, and reduce administrative burdens, creating a smoother, more effective staffing experience for both clients and contingent workers.\r\n</p>', 'Connect with Us', 'https://hamzahk15.sg-host.com/contact/', '1', 'Published', 'How Our Vendor Management Model Works', '<p>\r\nPresent the solution in a 5-step process, visually laid out:\r\n</p>', '2947', 'Vendor Program Assessment', 'Analyze supplier agreements, performance, and cost structures.', 'Centralized Oversight', 'Serves as your single point of contact for all staffing suppliers while also providing access to our own global network of pre-vetted, high-quality vendors to ensure consistent performance, faster response times, and reliable workforce delivery.', 'Performance Management', 'Reviews, and benchmarks to ensure accountability.', 'Cost & Compliance Control', 'Monitor billing accuracy, enforce rate cards, manage timely and accurate payments to vendors, and reduce financial and regulatory risks.', 'Reporting & Insights', 'Track spend and vendor efficiency.', 'Talk to an Expert', '<p>\r\nIf your goals include better visibility, meaningful savings, stronger compliance, and more control over your contingent workforce, TimeMatters is here to support you.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nLet’s discuss how we can strengthen your contingent workforce program.\r\n</p>', 'Schedule a Consultation', 'https://hamzahk15.sg-host.com/contact/', '', '', '', 20, 20, NULL, '2026-04-11 06:22:03', '2026-04-16 08:06:58', NULL);

