(2, 'home-page-settings', '3', '{\"id\":3,\"meta_title\":\"Delaware Garage Doors | Installation, Repair & Service | Clark and Sons\",\"meta_keyword\":\"garage door delaware, garage door installation delaware, garage door company delaware\",\"meta_description\":\"Clark & Sons is Delaware\'s trusted garage door expert with 60+ years of experience, offering residential and commercial installation, repair, & maintenance. Call Now\",\"banner_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"banner_title\\\":\\\"Delaware & Delmarva\'s Most Trusted Garage Door Company\\\",\\\"banner_subtitle\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"banner_description\\\":\\\"<p>Proudly Serving Delaware & the Entire Delmarva Peninsula for Over 60 Years<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"banner_img\\\":\\\"2862\\\",\\\"mobile_banner_img\\\":\\\"2794\\\",\\\"banner_img_1100x480\\\":\\\"2863\\\",\\\"banner_formtitle\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"button_label\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"system_setting_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"system_setting_title\\\":\\\"Garage Door Experts in Delmarva Peninsula Since 1963\\\",\\\"system_sub_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"system_setting_description\\\":\\\"<p>Clark and Sons specializes in the sales, installation, and servicing of top industry-leading garage door products throughout the entire Delmarva Peninsula. With four convenient locations, our skilled technicians provide dependable solutions, including expert spring repair, electrical troubleshooting, and complex installations.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Family-owned and operated for three generations, we proudly bring over 60 years of unmatched expertise as Delaware\\\\u2019s oldest independent garage door company. We help homeowners and contractors make informed decisions by offering exceptional value, personalized service, and a wide selection of quality products.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Visit our showroom today and explore your options, including visualizing your new garage door virtually!<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"system_img\\\":\\\"503\\\",\\\"system_img1\\\":\\\"21\\\",\\\"system_img2\\\":\\\"22\\\",\\\"system_img3\\\":\\\"24\\\",\\\"system_img4\\\":\\\"23\\\",\\\"title1\\\":\\\"Over 61 years <br>of experience\\\",\\\"title2\\\":\\\"Fully Insured\\\",\\\"title3\\\":\\\"Competitive <br> Prices\\\",\\\"title4\\\":\\\"Family Owned\\\"}\",\"service_heading_section\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"service_head_title\\\":\\\"Our Comprehensive Garage Door Services\\\",\\\"service_head_description\\\":\\\"<p>At <b>Clark and Sons<\\\\\\/b>, our experienced team delivers professional, high-quality garage door solutions tailored specifically to your needs. With over 60 years serving Delaware and the Delmarva Peninsula, we guarantee reliable and efficient services that keep your garage doors safe, secure, and performing smoothly.<\\\\\\/p>\\\"}\",\"services_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"services\\\":[{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Garage Door Installation & Replacement\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>Enhance your property\'s value and curb appeal with our premium residential and commercial garage doors. We offer a wide variety of styles, materials, and customization options, expertly installed by our skilled professionals to match your specific requirements.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"url_title\\\":\\\"Residential Garage Doors\\\",\\\"service_url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/clarkandsonsdoors.com\\\\\\/residential\\\\\\/\\\",\\\"service_img\\\":\\\"437\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Garage Door Repairs & Parts Replacement\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>Facing garage door troubles? Our skilled technicians offer prompt repairs and reliable parts replacement to quickly address any issues. From broken springs and snapped cables to damaged rollers, hinges, and weather seals\\\\u2014we handle it all. Our emergency repair services are available 24\\\\\\/7, ensuring minimal disruption to your daily routine.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"url_title\\\":\\\"Garage Door Repairs\\\",\\\"service_url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/clarkandsonsdoors.com\\\\\\/service-and-repair\\\\\\/\\\",\\\"service_img\\\":\\\"442\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Garage Door Opener Services\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>For seamless, secure garage access, our technicians specialize in installing, repairing, and servicing garage door openers. From traditional systems to advanced smart technology, we ensure your opener functions reliably and securely, providing maximum convenience and peace of mind.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"url_title\\\":\\\"Garage Door Openers\\\",\\\"service_url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/clarkandsonsdoors.com\\\\\\/residential\\\\\\/openers\\\\\\/\\\",\\\"service_img\\\":\\\"440\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Garage Door Maintenance & Service\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>Regular maintenance and professional servicing significantly extend your garage door\\\\u2019s lifespan and reliability. Our comprehensive tune-ups include safety inspections, lubrication, balance adjustments, hardware tightening, and detailed performance checks to proactively prevent common problems and ensure seamless operation.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"url_title\\\":\\\"Garage Door Maintenance & Service\\\",\\\"service_url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/clarkandsonsdoors.com\\\\\\/service-and-repair\\\\\\/\\\",\\\"service_img\\\":\\\"439\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Hollow Metal Entry Door Systems\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>Secure and strengthen your commercial or industrial property with our durable hollow metal entry door solutions. We offer expert installation, repair, and replacement of high-performance metal doors designed for enhanced security, fire protection, and longevity\\\\u2014ideal for warehouses, retail centers, and office buildings.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"url_title\\\":\\\"Hollow Metal Door\\\",\\\"service_url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/clarkandsonsdoors.com\\\\\\/commercial\\\\\\/hollow-metal-doors\\\\\\/\\\",\\\"service_img\\\":\\\"443\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Loading Dock Equipment Services\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>Streamline your business operations with our expert loading dock solutions. We install, maintain, and repair loading dock levelers, seals, shelters, and bumpers to ensure safe, efficient loading and unloading at your facility. Our team keeps your loading areas running smoothly and minimizes downtime.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"url_title\\\":\\\"Loading Dock Equipment\\\",\\\"service_url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/clarkandsonsdoors.com\\\\\\/loading-dock\\\\\\/\\\",\\\"service_img\\\":\\\"444\\\"}]}\",\"garage_door\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"door_title\\\":\\\"Common Garage\\\",\\\"door_button_name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"door_button_url\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"door_sub_title\\\":\\\"Door Problems\\\",\\\"garage_door_description\\\":\\\"<ul>\\\\r\\\\n<li>The garage door gets stuck open or closed.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>The door moves unevenly, and from side to side.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>You can hear loud noises when opening or closing the garage door.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>The door falls too quickly when being lowered in manual mode.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>The remote control door opener fails to work.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/ul>\\\\r\\\\n<p>If your garage door is suffering from any of these or other problems, give us a call. We will come and assess the problem and work out the best and most cost-effective solution for you.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"garage_img\\\":\\\"441\\\"}\",\"quote_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"quote_title\\\":\\\"Contact Us Today!\\\",\\\"quotesub_title\\\":\\\"Our experts are here to help. Contact us today for fast and friendly service.\\\",\\\"quote_button_name\\\":\\\"Request Help Here\\\",\\\"quote_button_url\\\":\\\"#getafreequote\\\",\\\"quotecall_button_name\\\":\\\"CALL NOW\\\",\\\"quotecall_button_url\\\":\\\"tel:+18004793667\\\",\\\"quote_desc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"residential_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"resi_title\\\":\\\"Garage Door Maintenance\\\",\\\"resi_sub_title\\\":\\\"Garage Door Service & Repair\\\",\\\"resi_button_name\\\":\\\"CALL NOW\\\",\\\"resi_button_url\\\":\\\"tel:+18004793667\\\",\\\"resi_description\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"gallery_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"gallery_title\\\":\\\"Our Work\\\",\\\"gallery_sub_title\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"areas_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"areas_title\\\":\\\"Four Convenient Locations\\\",\\\"areas_sub_title\\\":\\\"<div class=\\\\\\\"area-top-content text-center\\\\\\\">\\\\r\\\\n<p>At Clark and Sons Garage Doors, we\'re committed to providing timely, reliable service across the entire Delmarva Peninsula. With four conveniently located offices, we\'re always nearby and ready to assist you with expert garage door installations, repairs, and maintenance.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/div>\\\\r\\\\n<div\\\\r\\\\nclass=\\\\\\\"area-we-serve-location\\\\\\\">\\\\r\\\\n<ul class=\\\\\\\"two-column-list map-link\\\\\\\">\\\\r\\\\n <li><b><a href=\\\\\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/clarkandsonsdoors.com\\\\\\/locations\\\\\\/newport-garage-doors\\\\\\/\\\\\\\"> Newport, Delaware<\\\\\\/a><\\\\\\/b> \\\\u2013 Proudly serving Wilmington, Newark, and surrounding communities. <\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n <li><b><a href=\\\\\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/clarkandsonsdoors.com\\\\\\/locations\\\\\\/salisbury-garage-doors\\\\\\/\\\\\\\"> Salisbury, Maryland<\\\\\\/a><\\\\\\/b> \\\\u2013 Conveniently located to serve the entire Eastern Shore area.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n <li><b><a href=\\\\\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/clarkandsonsdoors.com\\\\\\/locations\\\\\\/dover-garage-doors\\\\\\/\\\\\\\"> Dover, Delaware<\\\\\\/a><\\\\\\/b> \\\\u2013 Centrally positioned to promptly assist homeowners and businesses throughout central Delaware.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n <li><b><a href=\\\\\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/clarkandsonsdoors.com\\\\\\/locations\\\\\\/georgetown-garage-doors\\\\\\/\\\\\\\"> Georgetown, Delaware<\\\\\\/a><\\\\\\/b> \\\\u2013 Dedicated to providing dependable garage door solutions across southern Delaware and coastal communities.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/ul>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/div>\\\",\\\"areas_button_name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"areas_button_url\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"areas_img\\\":\\\"351\\\"}\",\"faq_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"faq_title\\\":\\\"FAQ\'s\\\",\\\"faq_sub_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"faq_img\\\":\\\"436\\\"}\",\"why_choose_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"why_choose_title\\\":\\\"Why Choose Clark and Sons?\\\",\\\"why_choose_sub_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"why_choose_img\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"why_choose_img1\\\":\\\"433\\\",\\\"why_choose_img2\\\":\\\"432\\\",\\\"why_choose_img3\\\":\\\"431\\\",\\\"why_choose_img4\\\":\\\"435\\\",\\\"why_choose_img5\\\":\\\"430\\\",\\\"why_choose_img6\\\":\\\"434\\\",\\\"why_choose_title1\\\":\\\"Over 60 Years of Local Expertise\\\",\\\"why_choose_title2\\\":\\\"Fully Licensed & Insured Professionals\\\",\\\"why_choose_title3\\\":\\\"Family-Owned and Operated\\\",\\\"why_choose_title4\\\":\\\"Competitive & Transparent Pricing\\\",\\\"why_choose_title5\\\":\\\"Conveniently Located Across Delmarva\\\",\\\"why_choose_title6\\\":\\\"Top-Rated Customer Satisfaction\\\",\\\"why_choose_description1\\\":\\\"<p>Serving Delaware and the Delmarva Peninsula since 1963, we\'re Delaware\\\\u2019s oldest independent garage door company. Our three-generation legacy ensures unmatched experience and reliable service.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"why_choose_description2\\\":\\\"<p>Rest easy knowing your garage door is serviced by skilled, licensed, and fully insured technicians who prioritize quality, safety, and precision in every project.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"why_choose_description3\\\":\\\"<p>As a family-owned business, we put trust, honesty, and personalized care into every job. Your satisfaction and safety are our top priorities.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"why_choose_description4\\\":\\\"<p>We believe in fair pricing without hidden fees. Get clear, upfront quotes, affordable services, and exceptional value with every job.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"why_choose_description5\\\":\\\"<p>With four accessible locations, we\'re always nearby to quickly respond to your garage door installation, maintenance, or repair needs.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"why_choose_description6\\\":\\\"<p>We\\\\u2019ve earned the trust of thousands of homeowners and businesses through our commitment to quality work, fast response times, and friendly service, which is reflected in our 5-star reviews and loyal customer base.<\\\\\\/p>\\\"}\",\"blog_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"blog_title\\\":\\\"Recent Blogs\\\"}\",\"calltoaction\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"calltoaction_title\\\":\\\"Don\'t Try to Fix it Yourself!\\\",\\\"calltosub_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"button_name\\\":\\\"GET A QUOTE\\\",\\\"button_url\\\":\\\"#getafreequote\\\",\\\"call_button_name\\\":\\\"CALL NOW\\\",\\\"call_button_url\\\":\\\"tel:+18004793667\\\",\\\"call_button_desc\\\":\\\"It\'s crucial to entrust the repair of faulty garage doors to a skilled technician. Issues with cables or springs can pose significant hazards without proper expertise. With our extensive experience and specialized equipment, rest assured that all problems will be safely resolved.\\\"}\",\"design_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"design_title\\\":\\\"Design Center\\\",\\\"button_name\\\":\\\"DESIGN NOW!\\\",\\\"button_url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/raynor.chameleonpower.com\\\\\\/?dealer=true&did=0027\\\",\\\"design_sub_title\\\":\\\"Customize your garage door!\\\",\\\"design_description\\\":\\\"<p>Build the garage door of your dreams with our design center. Quickly scroll through our wide range of models, styles, and options, and request a quote in a matter of minutes.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"design_img\\\":\\\"132\\\"}\",\"newgarage\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"newgarage_title\\\":\\\"Need a New Garage Door?\\\",\\\"newgarage_desc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"testimonial\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"testimonial_title\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"clientlogo\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"clientlogo_title\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"form_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"form_title\\\":\\\"Need a New Garage Door or Service?\\\",\\\"form_sub_title\\\":\\\"GET IN TOUCH!\\\",\\\"form_short_desc\\\":\\\"<p>For any inquiries about our company, products, or services, please do not hesitate to contact us.<\\\\\\/p>\\\"}\",\"created_by\":null,\"updated_by\":\"5\",\"deleted_by\":null,\"created_at\":null,\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-18T17:17:36.000000Z\",\"deleted_at\":null}', 20, 20, '2026-04-06 11:59:58', '2026-04-06 11:59:58', NULL),
