ust of thousands of homeowners and businesses through our commitment to quality work, fast response times, and friendly service, which is reflected in our 5-star reviews and loyal customer base.<\\\\\\/p>\\\"}\",\"blog_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"blog_title\\\":\\\"Recent Blogs\\\"}\",\"calltoaction\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"calltoaction_title\\\":\\\"Don\'t Try to Fix it Yourself!\\\",\\\"calltosub_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"button_name\\\":\\\"GET A QUOTE\\\",\\\"button_url\\\":\\\"#getafreequote\\\",\\\"call_button_name\\\":\\\"CALL NOW\\\",\\\"call_button_url\\\":\\\"tel:+18004793667\\\",\\\"call_button_desc\\\":\\\"It\'s crucial to entrust the repair of faulty garage doors to a skilled technician. Issues with cables or springs can pose significant hazards without proper expertise. With our extensive experience and specialized equipment, rest assured that all problems will be safely resolved.\\\"}\",\"design_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"design_title\\\":\\\"Design Center\\\",\\\"button_name\\\":\\\"DESIGN NOW!\\\",\\\"button_url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/raynor.chameleonpower.com\\\\\\/?dealer=true&did=0027\\\",\\\"design_sub_title\\\":\\\"Customize your garage door!\\\",\\\"design_description\\\":\\\"<p>Build the garage door of your dreams with our design center. Quickly scroll through our wide range of models, styles, and options, and request a quote in a matter of minutes.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"design_img\\\":\\\"132\\\"}\",\"newgarage\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"newgarage_title\\\":\\\"Need a New Garage Door?\\\",\\\"newgarage_desc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"testimonial\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"testimonial_title\\\":\\\"What Our Clients Say ddfd\\\"}\",\"clientlogo\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"clientlogo_title\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"form_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"form_title\\\":\\\"Need a New Garage Door or Service?\\\",\\\"form_sub_title\\\":\\\"GET IN TOUCH!\\\",\\\"form_short_desc\\\":\\\"<p>For any inquiries about our company, products, or services, please do not hesitate to contact us.<\\\\\\/p>\\\"}\",\"created_by\":null,\"updated_by\":\"20\",\"deleted_by\":null,\"created_at\":null,\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-06T11:59:58.000000Z\",\"deleted_at\":null}', 20, 20, '2026-04-06 13:01:53', '2026-04-06 13:01:53', NULL),
(9, 'home-page-settings', '3', '{\"id\":3,\"meta_title\":\"Delaware Garage Doors | Installation, Repair & Service | Clark and Sons\",\"meta_keyword\":\"garage door delaware, garage door installation delaware, garage door company delaware\",\"meta_description\":\"Clark & Sons is Delaware\'s trusted garage door expert with 60+ years of experience, offering residential and commercial installation, repair, & maintenance. Call Now\",\"banner_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"banner_title\\\":\\\"Delaware & Delmarva\'s Most Trusted Garage Door Company\\\",\\\"banner_subtitle\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"banner_description\\\":\\\"<p>Proudly Serving Delaware & the Entire Delmarva Peninsula for Over 60 Years<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"banner_img\\\":\\\"2862\\\",\\\"mobile_banner_img\\\":\\\"2794\\\",\\\"banner_img_1100x480\\\":\\\"2863\\\",\\\"banner_formtitle\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"button_label\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"system_setting_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"system_setting_title\\\":\\\"Garage Door Experts in Delmarva Peninsula Since 1963\\\",\\\"system_sub_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"system_setting_description\\\":\\\"<p>Clark and Sons specializes in the sales, installation, and servicing of top industry-leading garage door products throughout the entire Delmarva Peninsula. With four convenient locations, our skilled technicians provide dependable solutions, including expert spring repair, electrical troubleshooting, and complex installations.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Family-owned and operated for three generations, we proudly bring over 60 years of unmatched expertise as Delaware\\\\u2019s oldest independent garage door company. We help homeowners and contractors make informed decisions by offering exceptional value, personalized service, and a wide selection of quality products.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Visit our showroom today and explore your options, including visualizing your new garage door virtually!<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"system_img\\\":\\\"503\\\",\\\"system_img1\\\":\\\"21\\\",\\\"system_img2\\\":\\\"22\\\