 needs.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"why_choose_description6\\\":\\\"<p>We\\\\u2019ve earned the trust of thousands of homeowners and businesses through our commitment to quality work, fast response times, and friendly service, which is reflected in our 5-star reviews and loyal customer base.<\\\\\\/p>\\\"}\",\"blog_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"blog_title\\\":\\\"Recent Blogs\\\"}\",\"calltoaction\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"calltoaction_title\\\":\\\"Don\'t Try to Fix it Yourself!\\\",\\\"calltosub_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"button_name\\\":\\\"GET A QUOTE\\\",\\\"button_url\\\":\\\"#getafreequote\\\",\\\"call_button_name\\\":\\\"CALL NOW\\\",\\\"call_button_url\\\":\\\"tel:+18004793667\\\",\\\"call_button_desc\\\":\\\"It\'s crucial to entrust the repair of faulty garage doors to a skilled technician. Issues with cables or springs can pose significant hazards without proper expertise. With our extensive experience and specialized equipment, rest assured that all problems will be safely resolved.\\\"}\",\"design_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"design_title\\\":\\\"Design Center\\\",\\\"button_name\\\":\\\"DESIGN NOW!\\\",\\\"button_url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/raynor.chameleonpower.com\\\\\\/?dealer=true&did=0027\\\",\\\"design_sub_title\\\":\\\"Customize your garage door!\\\",\\\"design_description\\\":\\\"<p>Build the garage door of your dreams with our design center. Quickly scroll through our wide range of models, styles, and options, and request a quote in a matter of minutes.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"design_img\\\":\\\"132\\\"}\",\"newgarage\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"newgarage_title\\\":\\\"Need a New Garage Door?\\\",\\\"newgarage_desc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"testimonial\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"testimonial_title\\\":\\\"What Our Clients Say\\\"}\",\"clientlogo\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"clientlogo_title\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"form_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"form_title\\\":\\\"Need a New Garage Door or Service?\\\",\\\"form_sub_title\\\":\\\"GET IN TOUCH!\\\",\\\"form_short_desc\\\":\\\"<p>For any inquiries about our company, products, or services, please do not hesitate to contact us.<\\\\\\/p>\\\"}\",\"created_by\":null,\"updated_by\":\"20\",\"deleted_by\":null,\"created_at\":null,\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-06T13:10:09.000000Z\",\"deleted_at\":null}', 20, 20, '2026-04-06 13:11:20', '2026-04-06 13:11:20', NULL),
