(12, 'home-page-settings', '3', '{\"id\":3,\"meta_title\":\"Delaware Garage Doors | Installation, Repair & Service | Clark and Sons\",\"meta_keyword\":\"garage door delaware, garage door installation delaware, garage door company delaware\",\"meta_description\":\"Clark & Sons is Delaware\'s trusted garage door expert with 60+ years of experience, offering residential and commercial installation, repair, & maintenance. Call Now\",\"banner_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"banner_title\\\":\\\"Delaware & Delmarva\'s Most Trusted Garage Door Company\\\",\\\"banner_subtitle\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"banner_description\\\":\\\"<p>Proudly Serving Delaware & the Entire Delmarva Peninsula for Over 60 Years<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"banner_img\\\":\\\"2862\\\",\\\"mobile_banner_img\\\":\\\"2794\\\",\\\"banner_img_1100x480\\\":\\\"2863\\\",\\\"banner_formtitle\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"button_label\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"system_setting_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"system_setting_title\\\":\\\"Garage Door Experts in Delmarva Peninsula Since 1963\\\",\\\"system_sub_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"system_setting_description\\\":\\\"<p>Clark and Sons specializes in the sales, installation, and servicing of top industry-leading garage door products throughout the entire Delmarva Peninsula. With four convenient locations, our skilled technicians provide dependable solutions, including expert spring repair, electrical troubleshooting, and complex installations.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Family-owned and operated for three generations, we proudly bring over 60 years of unmatched expertise as Delaware\\\\u2019s oldest independent garage door company. We help homeowners and contractors make informed decisions by offering exceptional value, personalized service, and a wide selection of quality products.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Visit our showroom today and explore your options, including visualizing your new garage door virtually!<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"system_img\\\":\\\"503\\\",\\\"system_img1\\\":\\\"21\\\",\\\"system_img2\\\":\\\"22\\