per expertise. With our extensive experience and specialized equipment, rest assured that all problems will be safely resolved.\\\"}\",\"design_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"design_title\\\":\\\"Design Center\\\",\\\"button_name\\\":\\\"DESIGN NOW!\\\",\\\"button_url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/raynor.chameleonpower.com\\\\\\/?dealer=true&did=0027\\\",\\\"design_sub_title\\\":\\\"Customize your garage door!\\\",\\\"design_description\\\":\\\"<p>Build the garage door of your dreams with our design center. Quickly scroll through our wide range of models, styles, and options, and request a quote in a matter of minutes.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"design_img\\\":\\\"132\\\"}\",\"newgarage\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"newgarage_title\\\":\\\"Need a New Garage Door?\\\",\\\"newgarage_desc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"testimonial\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"testimonial_title\\\":\\\"What Our Clients Say\\\",\\\"testimonial_sub_title\\\":\\\"Real feedback from clients who value TimeMatter\\\\u2019s reliability and transparency.\\\"}\",\"clientlogo\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"clientlogo_title\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"form_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"form_title\\\":\\\"Need a New Garage Door or Service?\\\",\\\"form_sub_title\\\":\\\"GET IN TOUCH!\\\",\\\"form_short_desc\\\":\\\"<p>For any inquiries about our company, products, or services, please do not hesitate to contact us.<\\\\\\/p>\\\"}\",\"created_by\":null,\"updated_by\":\"20\",\"deleted_by\":null,\"created_at\":null,\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-07T08:15:39.000000Z\",\"deleted_at\":null}', 20, 20, '2026-04-07 11:02:37', '2026-04-07 11:02:37', NULL);
