(40, 'home-page-settings', '3', '{\"id\":3,\"meta_title\":\"Delaware Garage Doors | Installation, Repair & Service | Clark and Sons\",\"meta_keyword\":\"garage door delaware, garage door installation delaware, garage door company delaware\",\"meta_description\":\"Clark & Sons is Delaware\'s trusted garage door expert with 60+ years of experience, offering residential and commercial installation, repair, & maintenance. Call Now\",\"banner_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"banner_title\\\":\\\"Because Your Time is Valuable\\\",\\\"banner_subtitle\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"banner_description\\\":\\\"<p>Independent and impartial Vendor Management Solutions for optimized<br> staffing supplier programs.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"banner_img\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"mobile_banner_img\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"banner_img_1100x480\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"banner_formtitle\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"button_label\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"system_setting_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"system_setting_title\\\":\\\"Integrated Workforce Management Services Supporting Talent Access, Compliance, and Cost Control\\\",\\\"system_sub_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"system_setting_description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"system_img\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"system_img1\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"system_img2\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"system_img3\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"system_img4\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"title1\\\":\\\"Vendor Management Solutions\\\",\\\"title2\\\":\\\"Qualified Resources on Demand\\\",\\\"title3\\\":\\\"Payrolling & Independent Contractor Management\\\",\\\"title4\\\":\\\"Vendor Management Solutions Advisory\\\",\\\"note1\\\":\\\"Managing multiple staffing suppliers can create complexity, hidden costs, and compliance risks. TimeMatters simplifies this with a comprehensive, impartial Vendor Management Solution (VMS) designed to give organizations clarity, control, and confidence.\\\",\\\"note2\\\":\\\"Custom, mobile-first websites exceeding Core Web Vitals, structured for AI-readiness with semantic HTML and schema markup.\\\",\\\"note3\\\":\\\"SEO-optimized website copy and AI-citation content created through our signature content interview process. No writing skills required from clients.\\\",\\\"note4\\\":\\\"SEO-optimized website copy and AI-citation content created through our signature content interview process. No writing skills required from clients.\\\",\\\"btn_name1\\\":\\\"Explore More\\\",\\\"btn_name2\\\":\\\"Explore More\\\",\\\"btn_name3\\\":\\\"Explore More\\\",\\\"btn_name4\\\":\\\"Explore More\\\",\\\"btn_url1\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"btn_url2\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"btn_url3\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"btn_url4\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"value_highlight_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"section_title\\\":\\\"Value Highlights\\\",\\\"section_description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Independent & Impartial Expertise\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"As a vendor-agnostic partner (not a staffing firm), we provide objective oversight and unbiased recommendations, free from conflicts of interest.\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Single Point of Contact\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"We streamline communication by acting as your centralized partner across all staffing suppliers, reducing administrative complexity.\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Cost Optimization & Control\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Through rate standardization, billing accuracy checks, contract compliance, and negotiation support, we deliver measurable cost savings while improving financial discipline.\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Supplier Performance Management\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"We continuously monitor and manage supplier performance to ensure vendors remain accountable and aligned with your business objectives.\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Transparency & Compliance Assurance\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Our structured processes and ongoing oversight ensure adherence to contracts, rate cards, and labor laws\\\\u2014minimizing risk and providing peace of mind.\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Data-Driven Insights & Reporting\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Real-time reporting on vendor performance, spend analysis, and workforce utilization enables informed, strategic decision-making.\\\"}]}\",\"service_heading_section\":null,\"services_sec\":null,\"garage_door\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"door_title\\\":\\\"Common Garage\\\",\\\"door_button_name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"door_button_url\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"door_sub_title\\\":\\\"Door Problems\\\",\\\"garage_door_description\\\":\\\"<ul>\\\\r\\\\n<li>The garage door gets stuck open or closed.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>The door moves unevenly, and from side to side.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>You can hear loud noises when opening or closing the garage door.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>The door falls too quickly when being lowered in manual mode.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>The remote control door opener fails to work.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/ul>\\\\r\\\\n<p>If your garage door is suffering from any of these or other problems, give us a call. We will come and assess the problem and work out the best and most cost-effective solution for you.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"garage_img\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"quote_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"quote_title\\\":\\\"Contact Us Today!\\\",\\\"quotesub_title\\\":\\\"Our experts are here to help. Contact us today for fast and friendly service.\\\",\\\"quote_button_name\\\":\\\"Request Help Here\\\",\\\"quote_button_url\\\":\\\"#getafreequote\\\",\\\"quotecall_button_name\\\":\\\"CALL NOW\\\",\\\"quotecall_button_url\\\":\\\"tel:+18004793667\\\",\\\"quote_desc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"residential_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"resi_title\\\":\\\"Garage Door Maintenance\\\",\\\"resi_sub_title\\\":\\\"Garage Door Service & Repair\\\",\\\"resi_button_name\\\":\\\"CALL NOW\\\",\\\"resi_button_url\\\":\\\"tel:+18004793667\\\",\\\"resi_description\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"gallery_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"gallery_title\\\":\\\"Our Work\\\",\\\"gallery_sub_title\\\":\\\"Real feedback from clients who value TimeMatter\\\\u2019s reliability and transparency.\\\"}\",\"areas_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"areas_title\\\":\\\"Four Convenient Locations\\\",\\\"areas_sub_title\\\":\\\"<div class