options, and request a quote in a matter of minutes.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"design_img\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"newgarage\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"newgarage_title\\\":\\\"Need a New Garage Door?\\\",\\\"newgarage_desc\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"testimonial\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"testimonial_title\\\":\\\"What Our Clients Say\\\",\\\"testimonial_sub_title\\\":\\\"Real feedback from clients who value TimeMatter\\\\u2019s reliability and transparency.\\\"}\",\"clientlogo\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"clientlogo_title\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"form_sec\":\"{\\\"checked\\\":1,\\\"form_title\\\":\\\"Ready to Take Control of Your Vendor Relationships?\\\",\\\"form_sub_title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"form_short_desc\\\":\\\"<p>Discover how TimeMatters can streamline your staffing supplier management, optimize costs, and ensure compliance across your workforce program.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"form_btn_name\\\":\\\"Schedule a Free Consultation\\\",\\\"form_btn_url\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"created_by\":null,\"updated_by\":\"20\",\"deleted_by\":null,\"created_at\":null,\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-10T10:06:30.000000Z\",\"deleted_at\":null}', 20, 20, '2026-04-10 10:08:19', '2026-04-10 10:08:19', NULL),
