k Vendor Management Solutions\",\"banner_description\":\"<p>We\\u2019re here to help you simplify your staffing supplier relationships, reduce costs, and<br>\\r\\nensure compliance. Connect with our team today and discover how TimeMatters Inc. can<br>\\r\\nbring clarity and control to your vendor ecosystem.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\\"Because your time is valuable \\u2014 we\\u2019re here to listen, guide, and simplify vendor<br>\\r\\nmanagement together.\\\"<\\/p>\",\"banner_image\":\"2938\",\"reach_out_title\":\"Why Reach Out to TimeMatters?\",\"reach_out_description\":\"<ul>\\r\\n                        <li>Get impartial advice from an independent partner.<\\/li>\\r\\n                        <li>Understand how Vendor Management Solutions can benefit your business.<\\/li>\\r\\n                        <li>Receive tailored guidance for your staffing supplier challenges.<\\/li>\\r\\n                        <li>Connect directly with a dedicated expert who will respond quickly.<\\/li>\\r\\n\\r\\n                    <\\/ul>\",\"office_hours\":\"Monday\\u2013Friday, 9 AM\\u20135 PM (local time).\",\"created_by\":null,\"updated_by\":20,\"deleted_by\":null,\"created_at\":null,\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-13T12:55:30.000000Z\",\"deleted_at\":null}', 20, 20, '2026-04-13 13:10:17', '2026-04-13 13:10:17', NULL),
(87, 'page', '1', '{\"id\":1,\"title\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"slug\":\"privacy-policy\",\"content\":\"<h1>\\r\\n  Privacy Policy\\r\\n<\\/h1>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"col-xxl-12 col-xl-12 col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-12 privacy-sec-text\\\">\\r\\n  <p>\\r\\n  At Raynor Garage Doors of Central Nebraska, protecting your privacy and maintaining your trust are\\r\\n                        extremely important to us. This Privacy Policy (\\u201cPolicy\\u201d) explains how we collect, use, store, and\\r\\n                        protect information when you visit our website at\\r\\n  <a class=\\\"in-link\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/raynordoorsofnebraska.com\\/\\\">\\r\\n    https:\\/\\/www.raynordoorsofnebraska.com\\/.\\r\\n  <\\/a>\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nThis Policy applies only to information collected through your use of our website. Any previous\\r\\n                        interactions with our website may have been governed by an earlier version of this policy.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nWe may use collected information to enhance our services, improve customer experience, and operate\\r\\n                        our business more efficiently. If we make significant changes to how we use personal data, we will\\r\\n                        update this Policy and notify visitors through clear communication on our website.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nIf we intend to use your personally identifiable information for purposes that differ from what was\\r\\n                        originally stated, we will obtain your consent before doing so.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Policy Changes and Updates\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nRaynor Garage Doors of Central Nebraska strives to stay compliant with evolving privacy standards and\\r\\n                        best practices. Whenever this Policy is updated, the \\u201cLast Updated\\u201d date will be revised\\r\\n                        accordingly, and the new terms will become effective immediately.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nIf significant updates occur, they may be prominently posted on our website or communicated directly\\r\\n                        to users when appropriate. We encourage visitors to review this Policy regularly to stay informed\\r\\n                        about how their information is collected and protected.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Information We Collect\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nThe information we collect depends on how you interact with our website.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nIf you voluntarily submit information through contact forms, quote requests, service inquiries, or\\r\\n                            other website features, we may collect personal information such as:\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Name\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Phone number\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Email address\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Mailing address\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nProviding this information is entirely optional, and you choose what details to share.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nIn addition, our website automatically collects certain non-personal technical information to help improve performance and usability. This may include:\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    IP address\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Browser type and version\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Device or operating system\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Pages visited and navigation behavior\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Session duration\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Referring website URLs\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nWe may also use cookies or similar technologies to improve your browsing experience and better\\r\\n                        understand how visitors use our website.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nCookies are small data files stored on your device. You can modify your browser settings to block,\\r\\n                        manage, or delete cookies at any time.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Respecting Browser Privacy Settings\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nMany modern browsers include a \\u201cDo Not Track\\u201d (DNT) feature that signals to websites that users do\\r\\n                        not want to be tracked. At this time, there is no universally accepted standard for responding to\\r\\n                        these signals.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nBecause of this, our website currently does not respond to Do Not Track requests. If a standardized\\r\\n                        protocol is established in the future, we may update this Policy accordingly.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Website Analytics for User Experience\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nTo improve our website performance and user experience, Raynor Garage Doors of Central Nebraska uses\\r\\n                        analytics tools, including Google Analytics.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nThese tools help us understand visitor behavior, including:\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Pages viewed\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Device types used\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Time spent on the website\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    General navigation patterns\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nThe data collected through analytics tools is aggregated and anonymized, and does not personally\\r\\n                        identify individual users. Google\\u2019s use of information is governed by its own\\r\\n<a class=\\\"in-link\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/policies.google.com\\/privacy\\\">\\r\\n  Privacy Policy\\r\\n<\\/a>\\r\\nand\\r\\n                        Terms of Service.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Advertising and Remarketing Practices\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nWe may work with trusted third-party advertising partners to display relevant promotional content\\r\\n                        across the internet. These partners may use cookies or similar technologies to show ads based on\\r\\n                        previous visits to our website.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nThese third-party partners do not receive access to personally identifiable information such as your\\r\\n                        name, phone number, or email address.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Children\\u2019s Privacy\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nRaynor Garage Doors of Central Nebraska does not knowingly collect personal information from children\\r\\n                        under 13. Our website and services are intended for adult users and homeowners seeking garage door\\r\\n                        services.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Payment Information Security\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nIf our website allows online payments or purchases, users may be asked to provide billing details\\r\\n                        such as credit card information or billing addresses.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nAll payment transactions are processed securely using industry-standard encryption and security\\r\\n                        practices to help protect your financial information.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Use of Google Maps and Location Services\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nOur website may integrate Google Maps services to provide location information or service area\\r\\n                        details. Your use of Google Maps features is subject to\\r\\n<a class=\\\"in-link\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/policies.google.com\\/privacy\\\">\\r\\n  Google\\u2019s Privacy Policy.\\r\\n<\\/a>\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nIn some cases, location data may be temporarily stored to improve functionality. You may request\\r\\n                        deletion of such data by contacting us directly.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Data Retention Policy\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nWe retain personal information only as long as necessary to fulfill business purposes, provide\\r\\n                        requested services, or comply with legal obligations.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nWhen information is no longer required, it will be securely deleted, anonymized, or archived in\\r\\n                        accordance with applicable regulations.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nIf an account or service relationship exists, we may retain certain data while the account remains\\r\\n                        active or as necessary for fraud prevention, technical maintenance, or legal compliance.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Opting Out of Marketing Communications\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nIf you receive marketing or promotional emails from us, you may opt out at any time by clicking the\\r\\n                        unsubscribe link included in the email or by contacting us directly.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nPlease note that even after opting out of marketing communications, you may still receive essential\\r\\n                        service-related messages such as appointment confirmations, service updates, or security\\r\\n                        notifications.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Updating or Deleting Your Account Information\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nIf you would like to review, update, correct, or request deletion of your personal information,\\r\\n                        please contact us using the details below.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nWe will process such requests within 30 days, subject to applicable legal requirements. After an\\r\\n                        account is closed or a request is fulfilled, personal information may be deleted or anonymized\\r\\n                        unless retention is required for legal, regulatory, or operational purposes.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Contact Us\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nIf you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or how we handle your personal data,\\r\\n                        please contact us using the information below:\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h4 class=\\\"adr\\\">\\r\\n  Mailing Address:\\r\\n<\\/h4>\\r\\n<h4 class=\\\"inc\\\">\\r\\n  Raynor Garage Doors of Central Nebraska\\r\\n<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nAttn: Gary Morris\\r\\n<br>\\r\\n  3830 S. 6th St. Unit 5\\r\\n  <br>\\r\\n    Lincoln, NE 68502\\r\\n    <br>\\r\\n      United States\\r\\n    <\\/p>\\r\\n    <p>\\r\\n    Phone:\\r\\n    <a class=\\\"txt\\\" href=\\\"tel:+14024132021\\\">\\r\\n      (402) 413-2021\\r\\n    <\\/a>\\r\\n  <\\/p>\\r\\n  <p>\\r\\n  Email:\\r\\n  <a class=\\\"txt\\\" href=\\\"mailto:gmorris.raynor@gmail.com\\\">\\r\\n    gmorris.raynor@gmail.com\\r\\n  <\\/a>\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",\"published_at\":\"2026-04-15 04:57:32\",\"author\":\"20\",\"image\":null,\"visibility\":\"Public\",\"password\":null,\"publish_status\":\"Published\",\"make_with_builder\":\"0\",\"page_slider\":\"0\",\"page_attribute\":null,\"page_template\":\"0\",\"header_banner\":\"0\",\"header_banner_img\":null,\"header_banner_title\":null,\"header_banner_subtitle\":null,\"meta_title\":null,\"meta_keyword\":null,\"meta_description\":null,\"page_index\":\"on\",\"canonical_url\":null,\"created_by\":20,\"updated_by\":20,\"deleted_by\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026\\/04\\/15\",\"updated_at\":\"2026\\/04\\/15\",\"deleted_at\":null}', 20, 20, '2026-04-15 05:04:36', '2026-04-15 05:04:36', NULL),
(88, 'page', '1', '{\"id\":1,\"title\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"slug\":\"privacy-policy\",\"content\":\"<h1>\\r\\n  Privacy Policyqqqqsqdxwq\\r\\n<\\/h1>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"col-xxl-12 col-xl-12 col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-12 privacy-sec-text\\\">\\r\\n  <p>\\r\\n  At Raynor Garage Doors of Central Nebraska, protecting your privacy and maintaining your trust are\\r\\n                        extremely important to us. This Privacy Policy (\\u201cPolicy\\u201d) explains how we collect, use, store, and\\r\\n                        protect information when you visit our website at\\r\\n  <a class=\\\"in-link\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/raynordoorsofnebraska.com\\/\\\">\\r\\n    https:\\/\\/www.raynordoorsofnebraska.com\\/.\\r\\n  <\\/a>\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nThis Policy applies only to information collected through your use of our website. Any previous\\r\\n                        interactions with our website may have been governed by an earlier version of this policy.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nWe may use collected information to enhance our services, improve customer experience, and operate\\r\\n                        our business more efficiently. If we make significant changes to how we use personal data, we will\\r\\n                        update this Policy and notify visitors through clear communication on our website.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nIf we intend to use your personally identifiable information for purposes that differ from what was\\r\\n                        originally stated, we will obtain your consent before doing so.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Policy Changes and Updates\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nRaynor Garage Doors of Central Nebraska strives to stay compliant with evolving privacy standards and\\r\\n                        best practices. Whenever this Policy is updated, the \\u201cLast Updated\\u201d date will be revised\\r\\n                        accordingly, and the new terms will become effective immediately.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nIf significant updates occur, they may be prominently posted on our website or communicated directly\\r\\n                        to users when appropriate. We encourage visitors to review this Policy regularly to stay informed\\r\\n                        about how their information is collected and protected.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Information We Collect\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nThe information we collect depends on how you interact with our website.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nIf you voluntarily submit information through contact forms, quote requests, service inquiries, or\\r\\n                            other website features, we may collect personal information such as:\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Name\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Phone number\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Email address\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Mailing address\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nProviding this information is entirely optional, and you choose what details to share.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nIn addition, our website automatically collects certain non-personal technical information to help improve performance and usability. This may include:\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    IP address\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Browser type and version\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Device or operating system\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Pages visited and navigation behavior\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Session duration\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Referring website URLs\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nWe may also use cookies or similar technologies to improve your browsing experience and better\\r\\n                        understand how visitors use our website.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nCookies are small data files stored on your device. You can modify your browser settings to block,\\r\\n                        manage, or delete cookies at any time.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Respecting Browser Privacy Settings\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nMany modern browsers include a \\u201cDo Not Track\\u201d (DNT) feature that signals to websites that users do\\r\\n                        not want to be tracked. At this time, there is no universally accepted standard for responding to\\r\\n                        these signals.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nBecause of this, our website currently does not respond to Do Not Track requests. If a standardized\\r\\n                        protocol is established in the future, we may update this Policy accordingly.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Website Analytics for User Experience\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nTo improve our website performance and user experience, Raynor Garage Doors of Central Nebraska uses\\r\\n                        analytics tools, including Google Analytics.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nThese tools help us understand visitor behavior, including:\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Pages viewed\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Device types used\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    Time spent on the website\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>\\r\\n    General navigation patterns\\r\\n  <\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nThe data collected through analytics tools is aggregated and anonymized, and does not personally\\r\\n                        identify individual users. Google\\u2019s use of information is governed by its own\\r\\n<a class=\\\"in-link\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/policies.google.com\\/privacy\\\">\\r\\n  Privacy Policy\\r\\n<\\/a>\\r\\nand\\r\\n                        Terms of Service.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Advertising and Remarketing Practices\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nWe may work with trusted third-party advertising partners to display relevant promotional content\\r\\n                        across the internet. These partners may use cookies or similar technologies to show ads based on\\r\\n                        previous visits to our website.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nThese third-party partners do not receive access to personally identifiable information such as your\\r\\n                        name, phone number, or email address.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Children\\u2019s Privacy\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nRaynor Garage Doors of Central Nebraska does not knowingly collect personal information from children\\r\\n                        under 13. Our website and services are intended for adult users and homeowners seeking garage door\\r\\n                        services.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Payment Information Security\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nIf our website allows online payments or purchases, users may be asked to provide billing details\\r\\n                        such as credit card information or billing addresses.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nAll payment transactions are processed securely using industry-standard encryption and security\\r\\n                        practices to help protect your financial information.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Use of Google Maps and Location Services\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nOur website may integrate Google Maps services to provide location information or service area\\r\\n                        details. Your use of Google Maps features is subject to\\r\\n<a class=\\\"in-link\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/policies.google.com\\/privacy\\\">\\r\\n  Google\\u2019s Privacy Policy.\\r\\n<\\/a>\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nIn some cases, location data may be temporarily stored to improve functionality. You may request\\r\\n                        deletion of such data by contacting us directly.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Data Retention Policy\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nWe retain personal information only as long as necessary to fulfill business purposes, provide\\r\\n                        requested services, or comply with legal obligations.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nWhen information is no longer required, it will be securely deleted, anonymized, or archived in\\r\\n                        accordance with applicable regulations.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nIf an account or service relationship exists, we may retain certain data while the account remains\\r\\n                        active or as necessary for fraud prevention, technical maintenance, or legal compliance.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Opting Out of Marketing Communications\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nIf you receive marketing or promotional emails from us, you may opt out at any time by clicking the\\r\\n                        unsubscribe link included in the email or by contacting us directly.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nPlease note that even after opting out of marketing communications, you may still receive essential\\r\\n                        service-related messages such as appointment confirmations, service updates, or security\\r\\n                        notifications.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Updating or Deleting Your Account Information\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nIf you would like to review, update, correct, or request deletion of your personal information,\\r\\n                        please contact us using the details below.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nWe will process such requests within 30 days, subject to applicable legal requirements. After an\\r\\n                        account is closed or a request is fulfilled, personal information may be deleted or anonymized\\r\\n                        unless retention is required for legal, regulatory, or operational purposes.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>\\r\\n  Contact Us\\r\\n<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nIf you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or how we handle your personal data,\\r\\n                        please contact us using the information below:\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<h4 class=\\\"adr\\\">\\r\\n  Mailing Address:\\r\\n<\\/h4>\\r\\n<h4 class=\\\"inc\\\">\\r\\n  Raynor Garage Doors of Central Nebraska\\r\\n<\\/h4>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nAttn: Gary Morris\\r\\n<br>\\r\\n  3830 S. 6th St. Unit 5\\r\\n  <br>\\r\\n    Lincoln, NE 68502\\r\\n    <br>\\r\\n      United States\\r\\n    <\\/p>\\r\\n    <p>\\r\\n    Phone:\\r\\n    <a class=\\\"txt\\\" href=\\\"tel:+14024132021\\\">\\r\\n      (402) 413-2021\\r\\n    <\\/a>\\r\\n  <\\/p>\\r\\n  <p>\\r\\n  Email:\\r\\n  <a class=\\\"txt\\\" href=\\\"mailto:gmorris.raynor@gmail.com\\\">\\r\\n    gmorris.raynor@gmail.com\\r\\n  <\\/a>\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",\"published_at\":\"2026-04-15 05:04:36\",\"author\":\"20\",\"image\":null,\"visibility\":\"Public\",\"password\":null,\"publish_status\":\"Published\",\"make_with_builder\":\"0\",\"page_slider\":\"0\",\"page_attribute\":null,\"page_template\":\"0\",\"header_banner\":\"0\",\"header_banner_img\":null,\"header_banner_title\":null,\"header_banner_subtitle\":null,\"meta_title\":null,\"meta_keyword\":null,\"meta_description\":null,\"page_index\":\"on\",\"canonical_url\":null,\"created_by\":20,\"updated_by\":20,\"deleted_by\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026\\/04\\/15\",\"updated_at\":\"2026\\/04\\/15\",\"deleted_at\":null}', 20, 20, '2026-04-15 05:05:45', '2026-04-15 05:05:45', NULL),
