 our website and\\r\\n            services. This may include your IP address, browser type, device information, and other technical details.\\r\\n            We use this information to analyze trends, administer the site, track user movements, and gather broad\\r\\n            demographic information for internal use.\\r\\n        <\\/p>\\r\\n    <\\/article>\\r\\n    <article>\\r\\n        <h3>2. Use of Information<\\/h3>\\r\\n        <p>\\r\\n            2.1 Providing Services: We use the personal information we collect to provide you with the services and\\r\\n            support you request. This includes responding to your inquiries, processing transactions, and delivering\\r\\n            relevant information.\\r\\n        <\\/p>\\r\\n        <p>\\r\\n            2.2 Communication: We may use your personal information to communicate with you regarding updates,\\r\\n            newsletters, marketing materials, and other information related to our services. You have the option to opt\\r\\n            out of receiving such communications at any time.\\r\\n        <\\/p>\\r\\n        <p>\\r\\n            2.3 Analytics and Improvements: We may use the information collected to analyze user behavior, improve our\\r\\n            website, services, and offerings, and optimize user experience.\\r\\n        <\\/p>\\r\\n        <p>\\r\\n            2.4 Legal Compliance: We may use and disclose personal information when required to comply with applicable\\r\\n            laws, regulations, legal processes, or enforceable governmental requests.\\r\\n        <\\/p>\\r\\n    <\\/article>\\r\\n    <article>\\r\\n        <h3>3. Data Security<\\/h3>\\r\\n        <p>\\r\\n            We implement reasonable security measures to protect the personal information we collect from unauthorized\\r\\n            access, use, disclosure, or loss. However, no data transmission over the internet or electronic storage\\r\\n            system can be guaranteed as 100% secure. While we strive to protect your personal information, we cannot\\r\\n            guarantee its absolute security.\\r\\n        <\\/p>\\r\\n    <\\/article>\\r\\n    <article>\\r\\n        <h3>4. Data Retention<\\/h3>\\r\\n        <p>\\r\\n            We retain personal information for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this policy,\\r\\n            unless a longer retention period is required or permitted by law. When personal information is no longer\\r\\n            needed, we will securely dispose of it.\\r\\n        <\\/p>\\r\\n    <\\/article>\\r\\n    <article>\\r\\n        <h3>5. Third-Party Disclosure<\\/h3>\\r\\n        <p>\\r\\n            We do not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer your personal information to third parties without your\\r\\n            consent, except as described in this policy. We may share your information with trusted third-party service\\r\\n            providers who assist us in operating our website and providing our services. These service providers are\\r\\n            contractually obligated to maintain the confidentiality and security of your personal information.\\r\\n        <\\/p>\\r\\n    <\\/article>\\r\\n    <article>\\r\\n        <h3>6. Your Rights<\\/h3>\\r\\n        <p>\\r\\n            You have the right to access, update, correct, and delete your personal information held by us. You may also\\r\\n            have the right to withdraw your consent for certain data processing activities. To exercise these rights or\\r\\n            if you have any questions or concerns about our privacy practices, please contact us using the information\\r\\n            provided below.\\r\\n        <\\/p>\\r\\n    <\\/article>\\r\\n    <article>\\r\\n        <h3>7. Changes to the Privacy Policy<\\/h3>\\r\\n        <p>\\r\\n            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or legal\\r\\n            obligations. We encourage you to review this policy periodically for any updates. Your continued use of our\\r\\n            website and services after any modifications to the policy will constitute your acknowledgment and\\r\\n            acceptance of the changes.\\r\\n        <\\/p>\\r\\n    <\\/article>\\r\\n    <article>\\r\\n        <h3>8. Contact Us<\\/h3>\\r\\n        <p>\\r\\n            If you have any questions, comments, or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our privacy practices, please\\r\\n            contact us at:\\r\\n        <\\/p>\\r\\n    <\\/article>\\r\\n\\r\\n    <article class=\\\"address\\\">\\r\\n        <h4 class=\\\"inc\\\">TimeMatters Inc.<\\/h4>\\r\\n        <p>\\r\\n            Address: 200 Consumers Rd #809\\r\\n            <br>\\r\\n            North York, ON M2J 4R4\\r\\n        <\\/p>\\r\\n        <p>\\r\\n            Email:\\r\\n            <a class=\\\"txt\\\" href=\\\"mailto:privacy@timemattersinc.com\\\"> privacy@timemattersinc.com <\\/a>\\r\\n        <\\/p>\\r\\n        <p>\\r\\n            Phone:\\r\\n            <a class=\\\"txt\\\" href=\\\"tel:+9058633993 \\\"> 905-863-3993 <\\/a>\\r\\n        <\\/p>\\r\\n    <\\/article>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",\"published_at\":\"2026-04-15 13:00:24\",\"author\":\"20\",\"image\":null,\"visibility\":\"Public\",\"password\":null,\"publish_status\":\"Published\",\"make_with_builder\":\"0\",\"page_slider\":\"0\",\"page_attribute\":null,\"page_template\":\"0\",\"header_banner\":\"0\",\"header_banner_img\":null,\"header_banner_title\":null,\"header_banner_subtitle\":null,\"meta_title\":null,\"meta_keyword\":null,\"meta_description\":null,\"page_index\":\"on\",\"canonical_url\":null,\"created_by\":20,\"updated_by\":20,\"deleted_by\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026\\/04\\/15\",\"updated_at\":\"2026\\/04\\/15\",\"deleted_at\":null}', 20, 20, '2026-04-15 13:30:08', '2026-04-15 13:30:08', NULL),
(129, 'page', '1', '{\"id\":1,\"title\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"slug\":\"privacy-policy\",\"content\":\"<section class=\\\"pricavy-banner inner-service-banner\\\">\\r\\n  <img src=\\\"\\/uploads\\/privacy-policy-banner.webp\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"img-fluid w-100 banner-img resizable-image\\\" width=\\\"1920\\\" height=\\\"767\\\" style=\\\"position: relative; display: inline-block;\\\">\\r\\n    <div class=\\\"banner-content col-12\\\">\\r\\n      <div class=\\\"container-md\\\">\\r\\n        <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\r\\n          <div class=\\\"banner-text\\\">\\r\\n            <h1 class=\\\"desktop-heading\\\">\\r\\n              Privacy Policy\\r\\n            <\\/h1>\\r\\n            <h1 class=\\\"mobile-heading\\\">\\r\\n              Privacy Policy\\r\\n            <\\/h1>\\r\\n            <p>\\r\\n            At TimeMatters Inc., we are committed to protecting the privacy and confidentiality of the\\r\\n                        personal information collected from our users. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use,\\r\\n                        store, and protect your personal information. By using our website and services, you agree to\\r\\n                        the terms and practices described in this policy.\\r\\n          <\\/p>\\r\\n        <\\/div>\\r\\n      <\\/div>\\r\\n    <\\/div>\\r\\n  <\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/section>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"col-xxl-12 col-xl-12 col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-12 privacy-sec-text\\\">\\r\\n  <article>\\r\\n    <h3>\\r\\n      1. Information We Collect\\r\\n    <\\/h3>\\r\\n    <p>\\r\\n    1.1 Personal Information: We may collect personal information, such as your name, email address, phone\\r\\n            number, and other relevant contact details, when you voluntarily provide it to us. We only collect personal\\r\\n            information that is necessary for the purposes outlined in this policy.\\r\\n  <\\/p>\\r\\n  <p>\\r\\n  1.2 Usage Information: We may collect non-personal information about your interactions with our website and\\r\\n            services. This may include your IP address, browser type, device information, and other technical details.\\r\\n            We use this information to analyze trends, administer the site, track user movements, and gather broad\\r\\n            demographic information for internal use.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/article>\\r\\n<article>\\r\\n  <h3>\\r\\n    2. Use of Information\\r\\n  <\\/h3>\\r\\n  <p>\\r\\n  2.1 Providing Services: We use the personal information we collect to provide you with the services and\\r\\n            support you request. This includes responding to your inquiries, processing transactions, and delivering\\r\\n            relevant information.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\n2.2 Communication: We may use your personal information to communicate with you regarding updates,\\r\\n            newsletters, marketing materials, and other information related to our services. You have the option to opt\\r\\n            out of receiving such communications at any time.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\n2.3 Analytics and Improvements: We may use the information collected to analyze user behavior, improve our\\r\\n            website, services, and offerings, and optimize user experience.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\n2.4 Legal Compliance: We may use and disclose personal information when required to comply with applicable\\r\\n            laws, regulations, legal processes, or enforceable governmental requests.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/article>\\r\\n<article>\\r\\n  <h3>\\r\\n    3. Data Security\\r\\n  <\\/h3>\\r\\n  <p>\\r\\n  We implement reasonable security measures to protect the personal information we collect from unauthorized\\r\\n            access, use, disclosure, or loss. However, no data transmission over the internet or electronic storage\\r\\n            system can be guaranteed as 100% secure. While we strive to protect your personal information, we cannot\\r\\n            guarantee its absolute security.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/article>\\r\\n<article>\\r\\n  <h3>\\r\\n    4. Data Retention\\r\\n  <\\/h3>\\r\\n  <p>\\r\\n  We retain personal information for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this policy,\\r\\n            unless a longer retention period is required or permitted by law. When personal information is no longer\\r\\n            needed, we will securely dispose of it.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/article>\\r\\n<article>\\r\\n  <h3>\\r\\n    5. Third-Party Disclosure\\r\\n  <\\/h3>\\r\\n  <p>\\r\\n  We do not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer your personal information to third parties without your\\r\\n            consent, except as described in this policy. We may share your information with trusted third-party service\\r\\n            providers who assist us in operating our website and providing our services. These service providers are\\r\\n            contractually obligated to maintain the confidentiality and security of your personal information.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/article>\\r\\n<article>\\r\\n  <h3>\\r\\n    6. Your Rights\\r\\n  <\\/h3>\\r\\n  <p>\\r\\n  You have the right to access, update, correct, and delete your personal information held by us. You may also\\r\\n            have the right to withdraw your consent for certain data processing activities. To exercise these rights or\\r\\n            if you have any questions or concerns about our privacy practices, please contact us using the information\\r\\n            provided below.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/article>\\r\\n<article>\\r\\n  <h3>\\r\\n    7. Changes to the Privacy Policy\\r\\n  <\\/h3>\\r\\n  <p>\\r\\n  We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or legal\\r\\n            obligations. We encourage you to review this policy periodically for any updates. Your continued use of our\\r\\n            website and services after any modifications to the policy will constitute your acknowledgment and\\r\\n            acceptance of the changes.\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/article>\\r\\n<article>\\r\\n  <h3>\\r\\n    8. Contact Us\\r\\n  <\\/h3>\\r\\n  <p>\\r\\n  If you have any questions, comments, or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our privacy practices, please\\r\\n            contact us at:\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/article>\\r\\n<article class=\\\"address\\\">\\r\\n  <h4 class=\\\"inc\\\">\\r\\n    TimeMatters Inc.\\r\\n  <\\/h4>\\r\\n  <p>\\r\\n  Address: 200 Consumers Rd #809\\r\\n  <br>\\r\\n    North York, ON M2J 4R4\\r\\n  <\\/p>\\r\\n  <p>\\r\\n  Email:\\r\\n  <a class=\\\"txt\\\" href=\\\"mailto:privacy@timemattersinc.com\\\">\\r\\n    privacy@timemattersinc.com\\r\\n  <\\/a>\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>\\r\\nPhone:\\r\\n<a class=\\\"txt\\\" href=\\\"tel:+9058633993 \\\">\\r\\n  905-863-3993\\r\\n<\\/a>\\r\\n<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/article>\\r\\n<\\/div>\",\"published_at\":\"2026-04-15 13:30:08\",\"author\":\"20\",\"image\":null,\"visibility\":\"Public\",\"password\":null,\"publish_status\":\"Published\",\"make_with_builder\":\"0\",\"page_slider\":\"0\",\"page_attribute\":null,\"page_template\":\"0\",\"header_banner\":\"0\",\"header_banner_img\":null,\"header_banner_title\":null,\"header_banner_subtitle\":null,\"meta_title\":null,\"meta_keyword\":null,\"meta_description\":null,\"page_index\":\"on\",\"canonical_url\":null,\"created_by\":20,\"updated_by\":20,\"deleted_by\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026\\/04\\/15\",\"updated_at\":\"2026\\/04\\/15\",\"deleted_at\":null}', 20, 20, '2026-04-15 13:40:35', '2026-04-15 13:40:35', NULL),
(130, 'abouts', '1', '{\"id\":1,\"meta_title\":null,\"meta_keyword\":null,\"meta_description\":null,\"title\":\"About Us\",\"description\":\"<p>\\r\\nWe deliver impartial and objective solutions that empower our\\r\\n<br>\\r\\n  clients to thrive.\\r\\n<\\/p>\",\"bannerimage\":\"2948\",\"abt_mb_bannerimage\":null,\"mobile_banner_image\":null,\"mission_values\":\"{\\\"status\\\":1,\\\"mv_post_1\\\":\\\"Managing Partner & CEO\\\",\\\"mv_post_2\\\":\\\"Chief Financial Officer (CFO)\\\",\\\"mv_title_1\\\":\\\"Brian Keyes\\\",\\\"mv_title_2\\\":\\\"Joanne Irons\\\",\\\"mv_title_3\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"mv_title_4\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"mv_title_5\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"mv_title_6\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"mv_description_1\\\":\\\"<p>Brian leads TimeMatters Inc. with a focus on impartiality, efficiency, and measurable results. With deep experience in vendor governance, he ensures that organizations gain control over their staffing supplier programs while reducing complexity and costs.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"mv_description_2\\\":\\\"<p>Joanne brings financial rigor and strategic insight to TimeMatters Inc. She oversees compliance, cost optimization, and fiscal transparency, ensuring our clients achieve maximum return on investment from vendor partnerships.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"mv_description_3\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"mv_description_4\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"mv_description_5\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"mv_description_6\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"mv_icon_1\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"mv_icon_2\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"mv_icon_3\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"mv_icon_4\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"mv_icon_5\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"mv_icon_6\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"missiontitle\":\"Who We Are\",\"missiondescription\":\"<p>At <b>TimeMatters Inc.<\\/b>, we believe your time is too valuable to be lost in the complexity of managing multiple staffing vendors. That\\u2019s why we specialize exclusively in <b>independent, impartial Vendor Management Solutions (VMS).<\\/b><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Unlike staffing agencies, we have no vested interest in supplier placement. Our role is to ensure that your vendor ecosystem operates with <b>transparency, accountability, and cost\\r\\nefficiency.<\\/b><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>For over two decades, we have partnered with organizations to help them reduce risk, optimize costs, and gain visibility into their contingent workforce programs.<\\/p>\",\"missionbutton\":\"Connect with Us\",\"missionbuttonurl\":null,\"teamtitle\":null,\"teamdescription\":null,\"teambackground\":\"2949\",\"button1\":null,\"button1url\":null,\"button2\":null,\"button2url\":null,\"historytitle\":null,\"historysubtitle\":\"Culture & Values\",\"historydescription\":\"<p class=\\\"section-subtext\\\">\\r\\n  At the heart of TimeMatters is a commitment to\\r\\n  <b style=\\\"font-weight:500;color:#333\\\">\\r\\n    Integrity, Independence, and the Success of our clients.\\r\\n  <\\/b>\\r\\n<\\/p>\",\"historyimage\":\"2951\",\"historybutton\":null,\"historybuttonurl\":null,\"our_history_title\":\"Our Specialists\",\"our_history_desc\":\"<p> Behind every client success is a dedicated team of professionals who ensure smooth delivery and support:<\\/p>\",\"how_we_deliver_title\":\"How We Deliver\",\"how_we_deliver_desc\":\"<p> We combine industry expertise, disciplined processes, and data-driven insights to deliver value to every client engagement.<\\/p>\",\"hwd_img_note\":\"Our culture is built on trust, professionalism, and a passion for helping organizations reclaim control of their vendor relationships.\",\"hwd_subtitle_1\":\"Neutral & Impartial\",\"hwd_note_1\":\"As a vendor-agnostic partner, we provide unbiased recommendations that serve only your organization\\u2019s best interests.\",\"hwd_subtitle_2\":\"Structured Oversight\",\"hwd_note_2\":\"Through compliance reviews, and standardized processes, we keep your staffing vendors aligned and accountable.\",\"hwd_subtitle_3\":\"Proven Results\",\"hwd_note_3\":\"Our clients consistently report reduced costs, improved compliance, and simplified vendor relationships.\",\"hwd_subtitle_4\":\"Dedicated Support\",\"hwd_note_4\":\"From financial oversight to administrative guidance, our team ensures you have the resources to succeed.\",\"cv_img_note\":\"Our culture is built on trust, professionalism, and a passion for helping organizations reclaim control of their vendor relationships.\",\"cv_subtitle_1\":\"Integrity First\",\"cv_note_1\":\"We are guided by honesty and transparency in every engagement.\",\"cv_subtitle_2\":\"Independence Matters\",\"cv_note_2\":\"Our impartial stance ensures our advice and oversight remain free of vendor influence.\",\"cv_subtitle_3\":\"Collaboration\",\"cv_note_3\":\"We partner closely with our clients, working as an extension of their team.\",\"cv_subtitle_4\":\"Excellence\",\"cv_note_4\":\"We hold ourselves to the highest standards in service delivery, ensuring measurable results.\",\"cv_subtitle_5\":\"Accountability\",\"cv_note_5\":\"Just as we hold your vendors accountable, we hold ourselves accountable to deliver value and impact.\",\"el_title\":\"Executive Leadership\",\"os_subtitle_1\":\"Consultant Accounts Managers\",\"os_note_1\":\"Builds strong client relationships and ensures seamless vendor management processes.\",\"os_subtitle_2\":\"Financial Benefits Expert\",\"os_note_2\":\"Oversee financial compliance, billing accuracy, and vendor cost optimization.\",\"os_subtitle_3\":\"Administrative Support\",\"os_note_3\":\"Provides critical organizational and operational assistance to keep client programs running efficiently.\",\"why_title\":\"Why TimeMatters\",\"why_desc\":\"<p> At TimeMatters Inc., we are more than consultants \\u2014 we are your partner in vendor governance. Our impartial, independent approach ensures you gain clarity, control, and confidence over your staffing supplier programs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><b>Because your time is valuable - we\\u2019re here to listen, guide, and simplify vendor management together<\\/b><\\/p>\",\"why_button_name\":\"Connect with Us\",\"why_button_url\":null,\"created_by\":5,\"updated_by\":20,\"deleted_by\":null,\"created_at\":\"2024-07-04T12:49:25.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-13T10:41:18.000000Z\",\"deleted_at\":null}', 20, 20, '2026-04-16 07:58:14', '2026-04-16 07:58:14', NULL),
